# yard_clay: specks of one or two pixels merged into their neighbours (the draft is finer-grained than the set),
# then the stripe the repetition check found: every other flagged pixel moved a ramp step toward the rest
clean orphans size=2
px 11,9 19,9 21,9 23,9 11,10 15,10 20,10 c=clay2
px 0,4 0,6 0,18 1,4 1,18 2,1 2,3 2,5 2,7 c=clay2
px 4,6 4,8 4,11 c=clay2
px 6,11 6,16 6,20 6,22 c=clay2
